<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3487" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρῐσία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκριτος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want of distinctness and order, confusion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.5.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ταραχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>want of judgement, bad judgement</i> or <i>choice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.35.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.629
			</span></i> (Antip.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τῶν φίλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>undecided character</i> of a disease, <i>not coming to a
				crisis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠέρος ἀ.</span>
			<i>unsettled</i> climate, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1796.22
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
